        "cue": 2,
        "caption": "One declarative artifact describes a codebase or research paper and compiles into frames, captions and video. Its provenance records are unsigned, not authentication.",
        "seek_seconds": 12.050500000000001
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/deep-audit-2026-11-09/cue-02.png",
        "sha256": "580c49534c7262b47d1a7c35c9d6cd2e82ff0e3f2e90448bbec216fd5ecd2585",
        "cue": 3,
        "caption": "A demo is a declarative spine: scenes of narration chunks, each an ordered stream of typed actions. Three ideas carry the whole system.",
        "seek_seconds": 22.3185
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/deep-audit-2026-11-09/cue-05.png",
        "sha256": "448db604daadfa105f7fc04ff428c18f7ad5665c7f6cf50df4ad3bec15f160ed",
        "cue": 6,
        "caption": "Clip duration is measured. Word timing is estimated: the default transcriber spreads known text across the clip by character length. It does not detect spoken word onsets.",
        "seek_seconds": 57.9435
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/deep-audit-2026-11-09/cue-07.png",
        "sha256": "cc7154a572b41b731be62ced628dce50a08bcb5904eaf32304cdb1b76100ff06",
        "cue": 8,
        "caption": "YAML configuration selects themes, layout, resolution presets including four K, and encoding controls. Actual quality depends on input detail and encoding settings.",
        "seek_seconds": 76.5165
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/_videoframes/deep-audit-2026-11-09/cue-10.png",
        "sha256": "4dd1f2c099d4fd5dcfe1950c9d20a0b4457b7cbdcbf99e3c01a470f0a717ceb8",
        "cue": 11,
        "caption": "Eight subsystems share a declarative spine. Narration, rendering and export also depend on configuration, assets and the selected runtime environment.",
